THIRD-PARTY DATA
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The case bundles committed under cases/ are DERIVED from third-party data that is
NOT covered by the Apache License above. Each upstream source keeps its own terms,
and one of them is non-commercial. Read DATA_LICENSES.md before redistributing or
building a product on this repository.

Mandatory attributions, reproduced here as the upstream licences require:

  Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data (2021-2024), processed by Team Naap.
  Sentinel-1 GRD scenes accessed through Google Earth Engine (COPERNICUS/S1_GRD).

  Oil-spill detection dataset, Zenodo, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.13761290, licensed
  CC-BY. Dataset paper: Trujillo-Acatitla et al., Marine Pollution Bulletin
  204:116549 (2024). Part III is the authors' designated test set and is the
  held-out split behind every Stage 1 number this project reports.
  (Not to be confused with the Krestenitis 5-class benchmark, which is a
  different dataset, is not openly available, and is not used here.)

  Ocean currents: HYCOM. Surface winds: ERA5 (Copernicus Climate Change Service).
  Both accessed through Google Earth Engine.

  Vessel AIS: NOAA Marine Cadastre (United States, public domain) and Global
  Fishing Watch API v3. GLOBAL FISHING WATCH DATA IS LICENSED FOR NON-COMMERCIAL
  USE ONLY and that condition reaches the two bundles derived from it.

  Slick polygons used as a comparison target, never as ground truth: SkyTruth
  Cerulean public OGC Features API.

  Coastline: GSHHG, via the global-land-mask package.
